   1++66A5              ; =========================================================================
   2++66A5              ; PROJECT126 — ATM Turbo 2+ / NeoGS host-side IPC driver
   3++66A5              ; Version: P126_ATM_IPC v0.3.0
   4++66A5              ;
   5++66A5              ; This is ATM Z80 code. It runs on the 7 MHz host CPU.
   6++66A5              ; NeoGS is an independent Z80 and has its own private debug port #EF.
   7++66A5              ;
   8++66A5              ; The implementation follows the proven Project125 host transport v2
   9++66A5              ; handshake semantics. It intentionally contains no NeoGS-local IN/OUT
